        frequently used geometric primitive for meshing and describing volumetric
        objects in continuum-field simulations.
    </rdfs:comment>
        <rdfs:isDefinedBy rdf:resource="https://manual.nexusformat.org/classes/base_classes/NXcg_tetrahedron.html"/>
