                    shortest distance was found.
                </rdfs:comment>
        <rdfs:isDefinedBy rdf:resource="https://manual.nexusformat.org/classes/contributed_definitions/NXapm_paraprobe_distancer_results.html#nxapm-paraprobe-distancer-results-entry-point-to-triangleid-indices-triangle-field"/>
