        <rdfs:seeAlso rdf:resource="https://manual.nexusformat.org/classes/contributed_definitions/NXapm_paraprobe_nanochem_results.html#nxapm-paraprobe-nanochem-results-entry-delocalizationid-grid-iso-surfaceid-triangle-soup-triangles-volumetric-features-indices-feature-field"/>
