                </owl:onClass>
            </owl:Restriction>
        </rdfs:subClassOf>
        <rdfs:comment>
                        Halfwidth of the kernel about the central voxel.
                        The shape of the kernel is that of a cuboid
                        of extent 2*kernel_extent[i] + 1 in each dimension i.
                    </rdfs:comment>
        <rdfs:isDefinedBy rdf:resource="https://manual.nexusformat.org/classes/contributed_definitions/NXapm_paraprobe_nanochem_results.html#nxapm-paraprobe-nanochem-results-entry-delocalizationid-grid-kernel-size-field"/>
