                    </owl:Class>
                </owl:onClass>
            </owl:Restriction>
        </rdfs:subClassOf>
        <rdfs:comment>
                Direction of beam vector, its value is ignored. If missing, then the beam direction is defined as [0,0,1]
                and passes through the origin. Note, this field should be referenced by the parent group&apos;s ``depends_on`` field; also,
                as this field is a direction, its ``transformation_type`` attribute should be omitted.
            </rdfs:comment>
