            </owl:Restriction>
        </rdfs:subClassOf>
        <rdfs:comment>
          Mean value of :math:`Q` for this data point. 
          Useful when describing data that has been 
          binned from higher-resolution data. 
          
          It is expected that ``Q`` is provided 
          and that both ``Q`` and ``Qmean`` will have the same units.
        </rdfs:comment>
