            For each triangle values are reported for the angle opposite
            to the respective edges in the sequence how vertices are defined.
        </rdfs:comment>
        <rdfs:isDefinedBy rdf:resource="https://manual.nexusformat.org/classes/base_classes/NXcg_triangle.html#nxcg-triangle-interior-angle-field"/>
