             The field value is a scaling factor for the units attribute.
             It is recommended to set the field value to 1 and carry all the unit
             scaling information in the units attribute.
        </rdfs:comment>
        <rdfs:isDefinedBy rdf:resource="https://manual.nexusformat.org/classes/contributed_definitions/NXdispersion_function.html#nxdispersion-function-wavelength-unit-field"/>
