                    this is an array of length m of temperatures.
                </rdfs:comment>
        <rdfs:isDefinedBy rdf:resource="https://manual.nexusformat.org/classes/base_classes/NXmanipulator.html#nxmanipulator-temperature-sensor-value-log-value-field"/>
