                if the description specifies one-, two-, or three-dimensional microstructural representations.
            </rdfs:comment>
        <rdfs:isDefinedBy rdf:resource="https://manual.nexusformat.org/classes/contributed_definitions/NXmicrostructure.html#nxmicrostructure-configuration-dimensionality-field"/>
