                    during post-processing the results with the solitary unit modeling approach.
                </rdfs:comment>
        <rdfs:isDefinedBy rdf:resource="https://manual.nexusformat.org/classes/contributed_definitions/NXmicrostructure_score_config.html#nxmicrostructure-score-config-entry-solitary-unit-rediscretization-field"/>
