                            electrons entering the analyzer.
                            
                            To add additional or other slits use the APERTURE group of NXcollectioncolumn.
                        </rdfs:comment>
        <rdfs:isDefinedBy rdf:resource="https://manual.nexusformat.org/classes/applications/NXmpes.html#nxmpes-entry-instrument-electronanalyzer-collectioncolumn-iris-group"/>
