                                Could be a link to /entry/instrument/beam_probe/incident_energy.
                            </rdfs:comment>
        <rdfs:isDefinedBy rdf:resource="https://manual.nexusformat.org/classes/applications/NXmpes.html#nxmpes-entry-instrument-electronanalyzer-electron-detector-raw-data-photon-energy-field"/>
