                </owl:onClass>
            </owl:Restriction>
        </rdfs:subClassOf>
        <rdfs:comment>
                        Description of relation of the beam with the sample. How does the
                        sample hit the beam, e.g. &apos;center of sample, long edge parallel
                        to the plane of incidence&apos;.
