                        stage&apos;s &quot;transformations&quot; entry.
                    </rdfs:comment>
        <rdfs:isDefinedBy rdf:resource="https://manual.nexusformat.org/classes/applications/NXoptical_spectroscopy.html#nxoptical-spectroscopy-entry-instrument-sample-stage-beam-sample-relation-field"/>
