        <rdfs:comment>
      Path to an :ref:`NXtransformations` that defining the axis on
      which the orientation of the surface depends.
    </rdfs:comment>
        <rdfs:isDefinedBy rdf:resource="https://manual.nexusformat.org/classes/contributed_definitions/NXquadric.html#nxquadric-depends-on-field"/>
        <rdfs:label>NXquadric/depends_on</rdfs:label>
