                    </owl:Class>
                </owl:onClass>
            </owl:Restriction>
        </rdfs:subClassOf>
        <rdfs:comment>
        (optional) UUID identifier for this entry.

        See the `UUID standard &lt;https://www.rfc-editor.org/rfc/rfc4122.html&gt;`__ (or
        `wikipedia &lt;https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Universally_unique_identifier&gt;`__)
        for more information.

        * For `bluesky &lt;https://blueskyproject.io/&gt;`__ users, this is the
          run&apos;s `&quot;uid&quot;` and is expected for that application.
        * Typically, `SPEC &lt;https://certif.com/content/spec/&gt;`__ users will
          not use this field without further engineering.
      </rdfs:comment>
        <rdfs:isDefinedBy rdf:resource="https://manual.nexusformat.org/classes/contributed_definitions/NXxpcs.html#nxxpcs-entry-entry-identifier-uuid-field"/>
        <rdfs:label>NXxpcs/ENTRY/entry_identifier_uuid</rdfs:label>
        <rdfs:seeAlso rdf:resource="https://manual.nexusformat.org/classes/contributed_definitions/NXxpcs.html#nxxpcs-entry-entry-identifier-uuid-field"/>
    </owl:Class>
    


